{"id": "EUVD-2026-103828", "enisaUuid": "04f3054e-404e-3b6e-aec4-9b4d773abe84", "description": "In the Linux kernel, the following vulnerability has been resolved:\n\nASoC: codecs: rt1017-sdca-sdw: fix uninitialized stream_config->type\n\nstream_config is not initialized before being passed to\nsdw_stream_add_slave().  The type field may contain garbage and is\nlater copied to stream->type by sdw_config_stream().\n\nZero-initialize stream_config so type defaults to SDW_STREAM_PCM.\n\nWhile at it, use snd_sdw_params_to_config() helper instead of\nopen-coding the same logic.", "datePublished": "2026-10-18T15:47:28", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-21T12:56:18", "baseScore": 0.0, "references": ["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/30a60e74ee71de027bf1387ac20d73e863bbf77b", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4e337c24c0a97fcdb394f954208971de5d372066", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/d195c8c763fdd0a7f74a34973f8946215a708f1e", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/7791ebf56eb4ab6b7a20252757a3029bc8068715", "https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/174d160884199cad97413f33fe1b56027dc0d3e1"], "aliases": ["CVE-2026-98743", "GHSA-33xw-2m9p-9fgf"], "assigner": "Linux", "epss": 0.17, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "0188538e-41b0-305a-bba1-f051618db383", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2b7aecd58528551e6e3da58091ff7ceb4718e6be <7791ebf56eb4ab6b7a20252757a3029bc8068715"}, {"id": "085868d3-0c7d-33a2-88ad-4bde81b9729c", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2b7aecd58528551e6e3da58091ff7ceb4718e6be <174d160884199cad97413f33fe1b56027dc0d3e1"}, {"id": "213d7ded-91f7-3783-b813-3bf10cbcf1bf", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "2b7aecd58528551e6e3da58091ff7ceb4718e6be <30a60e74ee71de027bf1387ac20d73e863bbf77b"}, {"id": "36e6e01f-9c2f-3723-8b51-730331626e20", "product": {"name": "Linux", "vendor": {"name": "Linux"}}, "product_version": "patch: 0"}, {"id": "3edcdd68-88e5-3ef0-af3a-0d0fc00886ee